hitokakera no yume wo

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:38.430
Te ni tsukanda hikari wo

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:45.520
Next Episode

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:44.400
Brutus was a remarkable person, wasn't he?
Then why is he portrayed as so grumpy?

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:46.730
Maybe because he was yelled at,
like ''You too?''

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.820
Come to think of it, what did he do exactly?

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:50.740
That's not the issue here.

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:52.490
Alley-oop

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.860
Now I'm hungry from thinking too hard.

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:55.450
It's the season when we have so
many things to think about.

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:57.830
Okay, I'll eat before it gets mouldy.

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:02.460
Next episode is
''June 17th: ...Or an Indian''

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:06.530
Shaking

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:06.530
We'll be waiting at Yamabuki High,
so please join us again.
